  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧)\n- Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ざわめく\n\nETYMOLOGY:\nFrom ⟦ざわざわ→ざわざわ：05985_zawazawa⟧ (rustling, murmuring) + the verb-forming suffix ～めく.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {木|き}の{葉|は}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ざわめく: leaves rustle\n- ⟦{教室|きょうしつ}→教室：00794_kyoushitsu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ざわめく: the classroom buzzes\n- ⟦{会場|かいじょう}→会場：01269_kaijou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ざわめく: a murmur runs through the hall\n- ⟦{胸|むね}→胸：00972_mune⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ざわめく / ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧ざわめく: to feel a stir of unease\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦どよめく→どよめく：07922_doyomeku⟧: a sudden, louder collective reaction (a roar of surprise); ざわめく is a lower, continuing murmur.\n- ⟦ざわつく→ざわつく：26967_zawatsuku⟧: to be noisy and restless (more colloquial)",
